"malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 382093, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JzeY9HUW9VMdQ3cnRfpBuN", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 387783, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011zRhJfdPoU396XtheacX68", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-bankers-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) per FIN-212", "body": "## Problem\nThe nightly build fails because `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` expects banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring already said ROUND_HALF_EVEN.\n\n## Fix\nSwitch `round_money` to `decimal.ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, which matches the docstring and the test:\n- `2.675 -> 2.68`\n- `2.665 -> 2.66`\n\n## Verification\nCI run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n\nNote: this changes rounding for values exactly halfway between two cents (e.g. x.xx5 with an even preceding digit now rounds down). That is the intended FIN-212 behavior.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-bankers-rounding", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 418683, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011zRhJfdPoU396XtheacX68", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to open_pr timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-bankers-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 418683, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011zRhJfdPoU396XtheacX68", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 421727, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01PgssNvPYJYNXUWWKFTSYb4", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 422027, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Pg